>
>Sorry, I don't use credit-cloning, to the point where it seems I don't
>even know what it is.

1. Drop money on shopkeep's floor. Get credit.
2. Use credit to purchase shop items.
3. Resell shop items for gold.
4. Repeat 1-3 until you have no more credit.
5. Have pet steal money from floor and drop it outside the shop.
6. Rinse and repeat 1-5 until the shopkeep has no more money.
7. Buy what you like from the shop. Pick up the money (converting it from
credit to gold). 
8. Price ID everything you have (all items are sold for 45% of their
stock price in credit)
9. Walk out of the shop with all the money and any items you wanted from
the shop.

